No matter how many years hand-delivery takes, don't I want to convey it?! Don't I want to deliver it?!

135
00:22:17,871 --> 00:22:21,871
キミいつも愛をアリガトウ
Thank you always for your love, you!

136
00:22:21,871 --> 00:22:31,871
キュンキュン ラタチュラ メニメニ Oh yeah キュンキュンキュン 特盛んと? ず~~っとよろしくね♡
Kyun-kyun Ratachura Meni-meni Oh yeah Kyun-kyun-kyun extra-large portion...? Please take care of me fore~~ver♡

137
00:22:39,371 --> 00:22:45,371
ゆらゆらり はらほらり 色とりどり 乱れ咲き
Swaying, fluttering, colorful, blooming in disorder

138
00:22:45,371 --> 00:22:50,871
花の街 思い出す この空から
Remembering the city of flowers, from this sky above

139
00:22:52,371 --> 00:22:57,871
百花繚乱
Hyakka Ryouran

140
00:22:58,371 --> 00:23:06,371
筐な出来事から やってきたこの場所は
The place I've come to from uncanny events...

141
00:23:07,371 --> 00:23:10,871
はるか遠くに出逢った きらびやかな舞台
Is a dazzling stage met far, far away.

142
00:23:11,371 --> 00:23:21,371
はっとするほど鮮やかな色彩が訪れると知った あなたの無理難題に答えてく その度に
Whenever colors as vivid as a gasp visit, answering your impossible demands, every single time...

143
00:23:23,371 --> 00:23:36,371
あぁとぼけるようなきさてんが いない答え合わせで 辿り着いたその先に 新しい景色が待っているんだ
Ah, with an evasive diner, matching answers we never had, awaiting at the destination we reached is a brand new scenery.

144
00:23:37,371 --> 00:23:42,371
百花繚乱
Hyakka Ryouran

145
00:23:43,371 --> 00:23:48,371
まか不思議なミステリー 次から次に起こるたび
Each time a baffling mystery occurs one after another,

146
00:23:48,871 --> 00:23:55,371
巧妙なからくりも 暴いてみせましょう
Let's expose even the cleverest tricks!

147
00:23:56,371 --> 00:24:08,371
どんな難題でも 種明かしはあるんだ 不毛さ弱気にしない 必ずや導きたすから
No matter the difficulty, there's always a reveal. Don't be fruitless or faint-hearted; I'll definitely guide you out!

148
00:24:26,371 --> 00:24:30,871
あぁこの場所で触れた人の悲しみや喜びがある
Ah, here there is human sorrow and joy touched in this place,

149
00:24:30,871 --> 00:24:40,371
その一つ一つが心を震わせる
Each and every one of them makes the heart tremble.

150
00:24:41,371 --> 00:24:53,371
はっとしちゃうほど鮮やかな色彩が ここにあるんだ あなたの無理難題に答えてく 毎日毎日に
Colors as vivid as a gasp are right here! Answering your impossible demands, day after day...

151
00:24:54,371 --> 00:24:59,371
あぁとぼけるようなきさてんが いない答え合わせで
Ah, with an evasive diner, matching answers we never had...

152
00:25:00,929 --> 00:25:07,599
辿り着いたその先に 新しい私が待っているんだ
Beyond where we've arrived, a brand-new me is waiting...

153
00:25:07,979 --> 00:25:19,379
あの頃は想像もしてない未来が咲き始めている こんな日々も悪くはないかな
A future I never could have imagined back then is starting to bloom. Isn't a life like this not so bad?

154
00:25:25,579 --> 00:25:37,279
ゆらゆらり ひらひらり 離れては寄り添って 蘇生風に身を任せ 優雅に舞う
Swaying, fluttering, drifting apart and drawing close, surrendering to the revival wind, dancing gracefully...

155
00:25:58,279 --> 00:26:06,979
あの夢も 憧れも 落書きのままボヤけて 消える寸前
Right before those dreams and yearnings blur and fade away like mere doodles...

156
00:26:10,579 --> 00:26:18,779
「コレガイイ?」「これでいいの?」 ふてくされてる鏡に
To the sulking mirror, asking over and over, "Is this good?" "Is this really fine?"

157
00:26:19,479 --> 00:26:29,679
何度も問いかけた 泣きたい日も くじけそうな日も
Even on days I wanted to cry, even on days I felt like giving up...

158
00:26:30,479 --> 00:26:43,479
乗り越えよう 光を浴びなきゃ 夢というツボミは 開かないから
Let's overcome it! If we don't bathe in the light, the bud called our dream will never open.

159
00:26:48,279 --> 00:26:51,979
Are you ready GO! 走り出そう 取り急ぎスカウト
Are you ready, GO! Let's start running, rushing to scout ahead!

160
00:26:54,479 --> 00:27:00,279
うつむかない! 振り向かない! 明日はもっと Shiny!
Don't look down! Don't look back! Tomorrow will be even shinier!

161
00:27:00,479 --> 00:27:08,979
ジブン足で つかめ未来! 今すぐスタートボタンを押してみよう
Grab the future with your own two feet! Let's push the start button right now!

162
00:27:09,479 --> 00:27:15,479
私はこんなんじゃないはず!
I know I'm meant for so much more than this!

163
00:27:39,379 --> 00:27:44,679
諦めも 言い訳も 取りまとめにスカウト
Quitting and making excuses, let's round them all up and scout them out!

164
00:27:45,479 --> 00:27:50,479
垂れればに すがるには まだまだ若すぎじゃない?
Aren't we still way too young to be clinging to regrets?

165
00:27:51,479 --> 00:28:00,479
七転び 八起きでGO! 何度もリセットボタン押そう どんな夢もきっと
Fall down seven times, get up eight, and GO! Let's hit the reset button as many times as it takes. Any dream will surely...

166
00:28:01,479 --> 00:28:13,479
こんなんじゃないはず! 信じてみよう 私はこんなんじゃないはず!
Be so much more than this! Let's believe in it—I know I'm meant for so much more!

167
00:28:30,479 --> 00:28:40,979
私はこんなんじゃないはず!
I know I'm meant for so much more than this!

168
00:28:51,479 --> 00:28:58,979
Let the voice love take you higher! Great Days

169
00:29:04,379 --> 00:29:09,279
Shining! Justice! 目覚めて
Shining! Justice! Awaken...

170
00:29:09,479 --> 00:29:14,979
Brand-new! Bed-town! 交差する息吹
Brand-new! Bed-town! Intersecting breaths...

171
00:29:15,479 --> 00:29:20,979
潮風から塩風 飛んでる抜けて遠へ
Riding the sea breeze, soaring away into the distance...

172
00:29:21,479 --> 00:29:26,279
すれ違い行く道に 迷い込む
Getting lost along intersecting paths...

173
00:29:26,479 --> 00:29:33,279
ここに! 誇りかけて! 幸福が
Right here! Stake your pride! Happiness will...

174
00:29:33,479 --> 00:29:42,479
照らすおごのスピリット それは守り抜く光!
Illumine the spirit of our logo—that is the light we protect!

175
00:29:43,479 --> 00:29:52,479
Let the voice love take you higher! 集まる力で 時さえ超えて
Let the voice love take you higher! With our gathered strength, transcending even time...

176
00:29:53,479 --> 00:30:01,479
泣きない見えない ビーザサマー めぐる勇気で...
Never crying, never unseen, be the summer with a circulating courage...

177
00:30:19,243 --> 00:30:23,933
Break down, break down 鳴り響かせて
Break down, break down, let it resound...

178
00:30:23,933 --> 00:30:29,513
Brand new arrival すれ違う景色
Brand new arrival, passing scenery

179
00:30:29,513 --> 00:30:34,493
雲の切れ間にさす 光がほら降り注ぎ
Sunlight piercing through the breaks in the clouds...

180
00:30:34,493 --> 00:30:40,253
いにしえの黒い道へ 脱走をいれこむ
Dashing into the ancient dark path...

181
00:30:41,093 --> 00:30:54,293
きらめき 導く街 絶たぎる黄金のスピリット それは果てしない絆
A sparkling, guiding town, a boiling golden spirit, that is an endless bond...

182
00:30:58,493 --> 00:31:02,893
Let the joy of love give you an answer

183
00:31:03,093 --> 00:31:13,293
分かれの時さえ 砕ける意志で 泣き出しそうな ビザサマー
Even in the time of parting, with a shattering will, a tearful visitor summer...

184
00:31:13,393 --> 00:31:23,093
自分を乗り越え 掴み取れ 未来
Overcome yourself and seize the future!

185
00:31:55,087 --> 00:32:05,287
Let the voice of love take you higher

186
00:32:07,087 --> 00:32:18,087
Let the joy of love give you an answer

187
00:32:19,087 --> 00:32:28,587
交わす勇気が 生むんだ賛歌
The courage we exchange gives birth to a hymn

188
00:32:32,087 --> 00:32:48,087
Break down, break down...

189
00:32:53,943 --> 00:33:01,893
てなわけで、「Great Days」お届けいたしましたー！
And that's why we performed "Great Days"!

190
00:33:01,893 --> 00:33:04,193
みんな楽しんでくれたしかー！
Did everyone enjoy it?!

191
00:33:05,033 --> 00:33:12,593
ここまではですね、まずめにしゅきラッシュっしゅ！
Up to this point, first "Menishuki Rush-sshu!"

192
00:33:24,593 --> 00:33:39,087
百花繚乱でかっこよく踊りました
And we danced coolly to "Hyakka Ryouran".

193
00:33:40,087 --> 00:33:56,087
そして、こんなんじゃないっ！ではね、ノエちゃめとね...
And then, in "Konna n Janai!", Noel and Watame and...

194
00:33:56,087 --> 00:34:24,087
ペンライト振ってほしいと思って踊らせていただきました！
We danced hoping you'd wave your penlights!

195
00:34:24,087 --> 00:34:38,087
そしてなんと、ここからは嬉しいお知らせとなっておりますー！
And what's more, from here on we have happy announcements!

196
00:34:39,187 --> 00:34:44,087
[Sign: 活動7周年記念フルセット]
[Sign: 7th Anniversary Full Set]

197
00:34:39,187 --> 00:34:53,587
なんと！大空スバル7周年記念ライブのグッズ販売告知！
What's more! Oozora Subaru 7th Anniversary Live merch sales announcement!

198
00:34:54,087 --> 00:35:06,587
グッズは4種類あります、めちゃめちゃあるということで早速見ていきましょう！
There are 4 types of merch, there's tons of them so let's check them out right away!

199
00:38:37,795 --> 00:38:41,095
それじゃあもうラストだよ！
Well then, it's already the final song!

200
00:38:41,095 --> 00:38:45,795
始めちゃっていいわけ？始めちゃお！
Is it alright if we start? Let's get started!

201
00:38:47,595 --> 00:38:51,395
よし、始めたいと思います。
Alright, I'd like to begin.

202
00:38:51,395 --> 00:38:54,595
よいしょ、よいしょ。
Heave-ho, heave-ho.

203
00:38:54,595 --> 00:38:58,595
それでは聞いてください。「ray」
And now, please listen to... "ray".

204
00:39:24,095 --> 00:39:30,595
お別れしたのはもっと前の事だったような
It feels like it's been a long time since we said goodbye...

205
00:39:30,595 --> 00:39:37,095
悲しい光は封じ込めて 踵すり減らしなんだ
Locking away the sorrowful light, I wore down the heels of my shoes.

206
00:39:37,095 --> 00:39:44,095
君といいた時は見えた 今は見えなくなった
When I was with you, I could see it, but now I can't see it anymore.

207
00:39:44,095 --> 00:39:51,595
透明な彗星をぼんやりと でもそれだけ探してる
Vaguely searching for that transparent comet, yet that's the only thing I'm looking for.

208
00:39:51,595 --> 00:39:58,595
しょっちゅう唄を歌ったよ その時だけのメロディを
I sang songs all the time, melodies meant only for that moment.

209
00:39:58,595 --> 00:40:03,383
寂しくなんかなかったよ ちゃんと…
I wasn't lonely at all, truly...

210
00:40:03,698 --> 00:40:06,768
しょっちゅう唄ってたよ その時だけのメロディーを
I'd always sing that melody unique to that moment...

211
00:40:07,638 --> 00:40:10,038
いつまでどこまでなんて
Asking how long, how far, or...

212
00:40:10,518 --> 00:40:19,868
正常か異常かなんて 考える暇もない程 歩くのは大変だ
whether I'm normal or abnormal—there's no time to think, walking is so tough.

213
00:40:21,538 --> 00:40:27,808
楽しい方がずっといいよ ごまかして笑っていくよ
It's way better to have fun, so I'll brush it off and keep smiling.

214
00:40:28,578 --> 00:40:34,928
大丈夫だ あの痛みは忘れたって消えやしない
It's going to be okay; even if you forget that pain, it never disappears.

215
00:40:36,738 --> 00:40:49,788
理想で作った道を 現実が塗り替えていくよ 思い出はその軌跡の上で 輝きになって残っている
Reality repaves the path built by ideals; memories remain shining upon those tracks.

216
00:40:50,768 --> 00:41:04,758
お別れしたのは何で 何のためだったんだろうな 悲しい光が僕の影を 前に長く伸ばしている
Why did we part ways? What was it all for? A sad light stretches my shadow far ahead.

217
00:41:05,518 --> 00:41:18,578
時々熱が出るよ 時間がある時眠るよ 夢だと分かるその中で 君と会ってからまた行こう
Sometimes I run a fever, and when I have time, I sleep. Within that dream I know is a dream, I'll meet you before going on.

218
00:41:19,538 --> 00:41:33,788
晴天とはほど遠い 終わらない暗闇にも 星を思い浮かべたなら すぐ銀河の中だ
Far from clear skies, even in endless darkness, if I picture the stars, I'm right in the galaxy.

219
00:41:34,518 --> 00:41:47,808
あんまり泣かなくなっても 靴を新しくしても 大丈夫だ あの痛みは忘れたって消えやしない
Even if I cry less often, even if I get new shoes, it's going to be okay; that pain never disappears even if forgotten.

220
00:41:48,698 --> 00:42:02,778
伝えたかったことが きっとあったんだろうな 恐らくありきたりなんだろうけど こんなにも
There must have been something I wanted to tell you; it was probably cliché, but even so...

221
00:42:18,338 --> 00:42:31,808
お別れしたことは 出会ったことと繋がっている あの透明な水晶は 透明だからなくならない
Parting ways is connected to having met; that transparent crystal won't vanish because it's transparent.

222
00:42:32,578 --> 00:42:46,468
丸バツ三角どれかなんて 皆と比べてどうかななんて 確かめる間も無い程 生きるのは最高だ
Asking if it's a circle, cross, or triangle, or how it compares to everyone else—there's no time to check, living is the best!

223
00:42:47,518 --> 00:43:00,788
あんまり泣かなくなっても ごまかして笑っていくよ 大丈夫だ あの痛みは忘れたって消えやしない
Even if I cry less often, I'll brush it off and keep smiling. It's going to be okay; that pain never disappears even if forgotten.

224
00:43:01,518 --> 00:43:11,798
大丈夫だ この光の始まりには 君がいる
It's going to be okay; at the beginning of this light, you are there.

225
00:44:26,578 --> 00:44:36,788
いっせーのせーで踏み込むゴールライン 僕らは何も まだ知らぬ
Taking a breath on "Ready, set," we step across the goal line, still knowing nothing at all.

226
00:44:37,518 --> 00:44:47,638
一線越えて振り返るともうない 僕らは何も まだ知らぬ
Crossing the line and looking back, it's already gone; we still know nothing at all.

227
00:44:47,878 --> 00:45:02,588
うだつてうだつてうだっていく 煌めく汗がこぼれるのさ 覚えてないこともたくさんあっただろう
Strumming along, gleaming sweat spills over; there must have been so many things we don't even remember.

228
00:45:03,944 --> 00:45:06,244
誰も 彼も 誰も 彼も シルエット
Everyone, anyone, everyone, anyone, a silhouette...

229
00:45:06,844 --> 00:45:10,744
大事にしてたもの 忘れたふりをしたんだよ
I pretended to forget the things I cherished so much...

230
00:45:14,244 --> 00:45:18,744
なにもないよ 笑えるさ
There's nothing there, but I can still laugh.

231
00:45:22,244 --> 00:45:26,744
いせのせで 思い出す少年
On the count of three, the boy who remembers...

232
00:45:26,744 --> 00:45:31,744
僕らは なにもかもを 欲しがった
We wanted everything.

233
00:45:32,244 --> 00:45:35,744
わかってるって あぁ 気づいてるって
I know... Ah, I've realized it...

234
00:45:36,744 --> 00:45:42,244
時計の 針は 日々は 止まらない
The hands of the clock, the days, they never stop.

235
00:45:42,744 --> 00:45:50,244
奪って 奪って 奪っていく 流れる時と流れる記憶
Stealing away, stealing, stealing away—time flowing and memories flowing.

236
00:45:50,744 --> 00:45:57,744
遠く 遠くなって 覚えてないことも たくさんあっただろう
Growing far, far away, there must be so many things I don't remember anymore.

237
00:45:58,744 --> 00:46:03,244
誰も 彼も 誰も 彼も シルエット
Everyone, anyone, everyone, anyone, a silhouette...

238
00:46:03,744 --> 00:46:08,744
恐れてやむこと 知らないふりをしたんだよ
I pretended not to know about the fear that refuses to stop.

239
00:46:09,244 --> 00:46:13,744
なにもないよ 笑えるさ
There's nothing there, but I can still laugh.

240
00:46:24,744 --> 00:46:29,244
ひらり と ひらり と 待ってる
Fluttering and waiting, fluttering and waiting...

241
00:46:29,744 --> 00:46:33,744
この木の葉のように 腕のことなく
Like these tree leaves, without losing hold...

242
00:46:33,744 --> 00:46:37,244
焦燥感 欲して 過ごしていたいよ
I want to spend my time craving that impatience.

243
00:46:37,744 --> 00:46:42,744
覚えてないことも たくさんあったけど
Though there were so many things I didn't remember...

244
00:46:43,744 --> 00:46:52,744
きっと ずっと 変わらないものがあることを 教えてくれたあなたは
Surely, forever, you are the one who taught me there are things that never change...

245
00:46:53,744 --> 00:47:00,744
消えぬ 消えぬ 消えぬ シルエット 大事にしたもの
Never fading, never fading, never fading... Silhouette, the things we held dear...

246
00:47:01,744 --> 00:47:06,744
持って大人になるんだ どんな時も
Growing up holding them, no matter the time...

247
00:47:07,744 --> 00:47:11,244
離さずに守り続けよう
Let's keep protecting them without letting go.

248
00:47:11,744 --> 00:47:18,744
そしたらいつの日か なにもかもを 笑えるさ
And then, someday, we'll be able to laugh at everything.

249
00:47:19,744 --> 00:47:27,724
ひらり と ひらり と 待ってる この木の葉が 飛んでゆく
Fluttering and waiting, fluttering and waiting, these leaves are flying away...

250
00:48:15,724 --> 00:48:19,724
[Title: スターライト]
[Title: Starlight]

251
00:48:24,224 --> 00:48:28,724
描いた未知の キャンバス 重なる景色
The canvas of the unknown I painted, overlapping scenery...

252
00:48:28,724 --> 00:48:33,224
繋いでみて 繰り返していく衝動
Try connecting them, the repeating impulse...

253
00:48:33,724 --> 00:48:38,224
揺らいだ 目の前に広がる世界
Wavering, the world spreading out before my eyes...

254
00:48:38,724 --> 00:48:43,224
星屑のメロディ 歌に乗せた
A melody of stardust, put into song.

255
00:48:43,724 --> 00:48:48,224
クラッと鮮やかに 眩ませるように
Dizzily and vividly, as if to dazzle...

256
00:48:48,724 --> 00:48:51,724
駆け抜けるよ スターライト
Running through, starlight!

257
00:48:51,724 --> 00:48:57,224
そう僕らは いつしか夢の中 光れて
Yes, before we knew it, shining within a dream...

258
00:48:57,724 --> 00:49:01,224
ただがむしゃらに 走り続けたよ
We just kept running on so recklessly.

259
00:49:01,724 --> 00:49:07,224
無限の宇宙に響いた キミを照らす声は
The voice echoing into the infinite universe, illuminating you...

260
00:49:07,724 --> 00:49:13,224
どこへだって きらり 飛んでゆけるんだ
Wherever it may be, sparklingly, we can fly away!

261
00:49:21,724 --> 00:49:26,224
愉快な仲間と 歩いた非日常
The extraordinary days walked alongside cheerful friends...

262
00:49:26,724 --> 00:49:31,224
掴んでみて 指先の一等星
Try grasping it, the first-magnitude star at your fingertips.

263
00:49:31,724 --> 00:49:36,224
滲んでゆく 目の前に広がった限界は
Blurting out, the limits spreading before my eyes...

264
00:49:36,724 --> 00:49:40,724
皆の手重ねて ぶっ壊して
Laying our hands together, shattering them apart!

265
00:49:41,224 --> 00:49:48,724
吸い込まれそうな 夜空を見上げて 今叫ぶよ スターライト
Looking up at the starry night sky that feels like it will swallow us whole, now I shout out, Starlight!

266
00:49:49,724 --> 00:49:55,224
そう僕らは いつでも側で 笑い合って
Yes, we are always smiling together by each other's side...

267
00:49:55,724 --> 00:50:01,724
あふれる声が 遠くこだまする 願いのかけらを...
The overflowing voices echo far away, the fragments of our wishes...

268
00:50:02,262 --> 00:50:05,062
願いのかけらを灯した 君の腕を引いて
Lighting up the pieces of our wishes, taking your hand...

269
00:50:05,562 --> 00:50:11,262
どこへだってきらり 飛んでゆけるんだ
We can sparkle and fly anywhere we want!

270
00:50:29,162 --> 00:50:33,462
ささやかな不安な日も 魔法をかけてハッピー
Even on anxious days, let's cast a spell for happiness!

271
00:50:33,762 --> 00:50:38,662
百人力で乗り越えていこう
Let's overcome it with a hundred times the strength!

272
00:50:38,962 --> 00:50:47,262
アクアブルーに染まる 大空へめかけた 鼓動が弾んでく
Toward the aqua-blue sky, our hearts are pounding!

273
00:50:50,862 --> 00:50:55,562
そう僕らは この日をずっと待ってたんだ
Yes, we've been waiting for this day all along.

274
00:50:56,062 --> 00:50:59,362
まだ覚めないでスターライト
Starlight, don't wake up just yet...

275
00:51:00,262 --> 00:51:08,262
僕らは止まらない その光が消える 1秒前まで走り続けるよ
We won't stop, running right up until one second before that light fades!

276
00:51:09,062 --> 00:51:15,162
無限の宇宙に響いた キミを照らす声を強く抱いて
Holding tight to the voice echoing through the infinite universe that illuminates you...

277
00:51:15,962 --> 00:51:21,362
きらり 輝いてゆけ
Sparkle and shine on!

278
00:52:04,062 --> 00:52:13,162
いつだって愛情が先に走り出す 僕らのランウェイを 胆力とラッキーを盾に進みます アイ・ユー・レディ？
Affection always starts running first on our runway. Armed with nerve and luck, we press forward. Are you ready?

279
00:52:14,062 --> 00:52:23,462
転んだって泣いたって僕ら 慣れてるよ 受け身はパーフェクト 笑ってくれてありがとう また僕は歌えるよ
Even if we fall or cry, we're used to it—our ukemi is perfect! Thanks for smiling, so I can sing again.

280
00:52:24,462 --> 00:52:29,362
人生は不安ばっか 正直自信はないけど
Life is full of anxiety, honestly I don't have much confidence...

281
00:52:30,062 --> 00:52:33,462
君の隣だけは譲る気はないのです！
...but I have no intention of giving up being right by your side!

282
00:52:34,162 --> 00:52:44,162
僕らが出会えた奇跡のセカイ 君の目にどう映るかな 青より澄み渡る僕だけの空だといいな
How does this miraculous world where we met reflect in your eyes? I hope it looks like my very own sky, clearer than blue.

283
00:52:44,862 --> 00:52:54,362
不確かな永遠より僕は 二人で過ごす今を歌いたいんだ この星の片隅続く あいまいゆえにダーリン アイ・ラブ・ユー！
Rather than an uncertain eternity, I want to sing about the present we spend together. In this corner of the planet, continuing through our ambiguity, darling, I love you!

284
00:53:04,862 --> 00:53:14,362
ナンセンスな現実が 心を乱していった ラッキーの天秤の裏側にあるアンラッキー
Nonsense reality threw my heart into chaos. On the flip side of luck's scale lies bad luck.

285
00:53:15,162 --> 00:53:24,162
転んだって泣いたって僕ら 立ち上がる 七転八倒さ 笑ってくれてありがとう まだ僕は走れるよ
Even if we fall or cry, we get back up—that's falling seven times and rising eight. Thanks for smiling, I can still run!

286
00:53:25,162 --> 00:53:29,662
人生の期待感は 正直膨らむばっかでさ
The anticipation for life honestly just keeps swelling up...

287
00:53:30,062 --> 00:53:34,162
君の心の中 灯る日だまりなのだ
It's a sunny spot glowing right inside your heart.

288
00:53:34,862 --> 00:53:44,162
僕らが暮らしてる奇跡の時代 君のコトどう照らすかな 曇りより煌めいた 僕らしい太陽になれたら
In this miraculous era we live in, how shall I illuminate you? If I could become a sun more dazzling than the clouds, truly like myself...

289
00:53:44,962 --> 00:53:55,262
不確かな永遠より僕は 二人で過ごす今を楽しんでいたい この星の片隅続く あいまいゆえにダンシング アイ・ラブ・ユー伝えたいの
Rather than an uncertain eternity, I want to enjoy the present we spend together. In this corner of the planet, dancing through our ambiguity, I want to tell you I love you!

290
00:53:56,062 --> 00:54:08,462
今日は本当におありがとうございました！ここまで活動できたのは応援してくれたみんなのおかげです！みんな大好きだぞー！
Thank you so much today! Being able to keep active up to this point is thanks to everyone who supported us! I love you all so much!

291
00:54:15,262 --> 00:54:24,162
ああ健やかな時も ああ病める時もきっと 伝えたいよこのメロディー
Ah, in times of health and in times of sickness, surely I want to convey this melody.

292
00:54:25,062 --> 00:54:34,362
僕らが出会えた奇跡のセカイ 君の目にどう映るかな 青より澄み渡る僕だけの空だといいな
How does this miraculous world where we met reflect in your eyes? I hope it looks like my very own sky, clearer than blue.

293
00:54:35,062 --> 00:54:48,462
不確かな永遠より僕は 二人で過ごす今を歌いたいんだ この星の片隅続く あいまいゆえにダーリン アイ・ラブ・ユー伝えたいの
Rather than an uncertain eternity, I want to sing about the present we spend together. In this corner of the planet, continuing through our ambiguity, darling, I want to tell you I love you!

294
00:57:25,133 --> 00:58:59,347
これからも、楽しい事いっぱいにしようね！
Let's keep doing lots of fun things together!!!

